    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003600/extras/174c487e78c48ff20a8d2666c42d630a.avif?t=1738086628\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-ENTER INTO NASHBORED-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You never know what lies in your mind. The complexities of life become laid bare as information and memories, lost in the slurry of day soup that surrounds your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In that chaos, many things can hide and take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught in a spiral and displayed on a sadistic gameshow for higher beings,<br>Nash will be thrust into the depths of her own mind.<br>Help her to navigate the strange pathways, and try to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-The Upper Dreamscape is a dangerous place-</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore through strange memories, meet weird entities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight psycho enemies who want you dead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange prerendered realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle to survive!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003600/extras/174c487e78c48ff20a8d2666c42d630a.avif?t=1738086628\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-ENTER INTO NASHBORED-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You never know what lies in your mind. The complexities of life become laid bare as information and memories, lost in the slurry of day soup that surrounds your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In that chaos, many things can hide and take shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught in a spiral and displayed on a sadistic gameshow for higher beings,<br>Nash will be thrust into the depths of her own mind.<br>Help her to navigate the strange pathways, and try to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-The Upper Dreamscape is a dangerous place-</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore through strange memories, meet weird entities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight psycho enemies who want you dead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover strange prerendered realms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle to survive!</p></li></ul>",
